393
00:16:14,100 --> 00:16:16,100
is asked to be at this meeting

394
00:16:16,100 --> 00:16:18,100
and promise that it's only gonna last

395
00:16:18,100 --> 00:16:20,100
for 15 minutes-

396
00:16:20,100 --> 00:16:23,100
Really only 15 minutes.

397
00:16:23,100 --> 00:16:25,100
So, before the meeting, get some index cards

398
00:16:25,100 --> 00:16:28,100
and list one task that needs to be completed

399
00:16:28,100 --> 00:16:30,100
or one position that needs to be filled

400
00:16:30,100 --> 00:16:32,100
on each index card.

401
00:16:32,100 --> 00:16:34,100
Open the meeting by welcoming everybody

402
00:16:34,100 --> 00:16:36,100
and tell them that you have a number of opportunities

403
00:16:36,100 --> 00:16:38,100
for helping make the Cub program

404
00:16:38,100 --> 00:16:40,100
possible for their sons,

405
00:16:40,100 --> 00:16:42,100
and then read each card you've prepared

406
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:44,100
and tack them to a bulletin board

407
00:16:44,100 --> 00:16:46,100
or tape them on the wall right there behind you.

408
00:16:46,100 --> 00:16:48,100
Conclude by saying

409
00:16:48,100 --> 00:16:50,100
that everyone will need to pitch in

410
00:16:50,100 --> 00:16:52,100
and that each of the parent's presence

411
00:16:52,100 --> 00:16:54,100
needs to choose what they would like to do

412
00:16:54,100 --> 00:16:56,100
out of the cards

413
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:58,100
that are tacked there on the wall

414
00:16:58,100 --> 00:17:00,100
and tell them: you know, the most attractive opportunities

415
00:17:00,100 --> 00:17:02,100
