00:17:06,099 --> 00:17:08,099
or the task that they like the most:

419
00:17:08,099 --> 00:17:10,099
One, two, three

420
00:17:10,099 --> 00:17:12,099
ready set go,

421
00:17:12,099 --> 00:17:14,099
And you know they'll sit there for a moment

422
00:17:14,099 --> 00:17:16,099
until they understand that

423
00:17:16,099 --> 00:17:18,099
oh, this is serious.

424
00:17:18,099 --> 00:17:20,099
I actually have to do this now,

425
00:17:20,099 --> 00:17:22,099
and the first parent will get up

426
00:17:22,099 --> 00:17:24,099
and take a card and then everybody will do it,

427
00:17:24,099 --> 00:17:26,099
and there's kind of a fun spirit to it.

428
00:17:26,099 --> 00:17:28,099
It's kind of a game, isn't it?

429
00:17:28,099 --> 00:17:30,100
And then ask everyone who's

430
00:17:30,100 --> 00:17:32,100
taken a card to write their name

431
00:17:32,100 --> 00:17:34,100
and contact information on the card

432
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:36,100
and hand it back to you before they leave.

433
00:17:36,100 --> 00:17:38,100
Tell them you'll be contacting them soon

434
00:17:38,100 --> 00:17:40,100
about what happens next,

435
00:17:40,100 --> 00:17:42,100
thank them for their time

436
00:17:42,100 --> 00:17:44,100
and say that you're looking forward to working together.

437
00:17:44,100 --> 00:17:46,100
Now, this might sound a little improbable,

