00:21:30,100 --> 00:21:32,100
you went into much more detail

551
00:21:32,100 --> 00:21:34,100
about the scout master

552
00:21:34,100 --> 00:21:36,100
committee member argument that you referenced,

553
00:21:36,100 --> 00:21:38,100
but I would say a good way

554
00:21:38,100 --> 00:21:40,100
of summarizing it was basically

555
00:21:40,100 --> 00:21:42,100
over what you had said

556
00:21:42,100 --> 00:21:44,100
and whether you were coaching

557
00:21:44,100 --> 00:21:46,100
or directing.

558
00:21:46,100 --> 00:21:48,100
What's interesting is that the committee member

559
00:21:48,100 --> 00:21:50,100
decided that they would

560
00:21:50,100 --> 00:21:52,100
be able to direct you

561
00:21:52,100 --> 00:21:54,100
rather than coach you.

562
00:21:54,100 --> 00:21:56,100
so they weren't really applying

563
00:21:56,100 --> 00:21:58,100
what they were arguing about, were they?

564
00:21:58,100 --> 00:22:00,100
If I had the ear of that committee member,

565
00:22:00,100 --> 00:22:02,100
the minimum of a couple of things.

566
00:22:02,100 --> 00:22:04,100
One is that they should be working in concert

567
00:22:04,100 --> 00:22:06,100
with the rest of the committee

568
00:22:06,100 --> 00:22:08,100
and that the chair of the committee

569
00:22:08,100 --> 00:22:10,100
and the scout master are the ones

570
00:22:10,100 --> 00:22:12,100
who ought to be discussing these things,

571
00:22:12,100 --> 00:22:14,100
rather than a committee member

572
00:22:14,100 --> 00:22:16,100
just kind of taking ad hoc initiative

573
00:22:16,100 --> 00:22:18,100
to do this.

574
00:22:18,100 --> 00:22:20,100
And it should be clearly understood

575
00:22:20,100 --> 00:22:22,100
that anybody who is stepped up

576
00:22:22,100 --> 00:22:24,100
into the scout master position-

577
00:22:24,100 --> 00:22:26,100
especially someone who filled the position

578
00:22:26,100 --> 00:22:28,100
because no one else was willing to do it-

579
00:22:28,100 --> 00:22:30,100
to report an encouragement as possible.

580
00:22:30,100 --> 00:22:32,100
I mean, how would any of us feel

581
00:22:32,100 --> 00:22:34,100
if, in their brand new position

