our work the first week we took on the job?

585
00:22:40,100 --> 00:22:42,100
No doubt

586
00:22:42,100 --> 00:22:44,100
the committee member in question

587
00:22:44,100 --> 00:22:46,100
is trying to be helpful, but let's get real here.

588
00:22:46,100 --> 00:22:48,100
That kind of thing

589
00:22:48,100 --> 00:22:50,100
is not really helping.

590
00:22:50,100 --> 00:22:52,100
The key concept

591
00:22:52,100 --> 00:22:54,100
I think that bears on the situation

592
00:22:54,100 --> 00:22:56,100
is that, when it comes to the committee

593
00:22:56,100 --> 00:22:58,100
and all of the parents of the scouts.

594
00:22:58,100 --> 00:23:00,100
they need to accept

595
00:23:00,100 --> 00:23:02,100
that the scout master is going to

596
00:23:02,100 --> 00:23:04,100
lead adults. He's the head coach

597
00:23:04,100 --> 00:23:06,100
and all the other adults kind of need to

598
00:23:06,100 --> 00:23:08,100
follow in line and follow the head coach.

599
00:23:08,100 --> 00:23:10,100
This is not to say

600
00:23:10,100 --> 00:23:12,100
that the scout master is going to order

601
00:23:12,100 --> 00:23:14,100
everybody around or not be open

602
00:23:14,100 --> 00:23:16,100
to suggestions,

603
00:23:16,100 --> 00:23:18,100
but that role of leadership

604
00:23:18,100 --> 00:23:20,100
is something that needs to be respected.

605
00:23:20,100 --> 00:23:22,100
The scout master has the right to accept

606
00:23:22,100 --> 00:23:24,100
or reject advice, to make decisions,

607
00:23:24,100 --> 00:23:26,100
to set the way forward. If the committee

608
00:23:26,100 --> 00:23:28,100
and the parents have basic

609
00:23:28,100 --> 00:23:30,100
disagreements with this

610
00:23:30,100 --> 00:23:32,100
and they aren't willing to accept this arrangement,

611
00:23:32,100 --> 00:23:34,100
they should find another scout master

612
00:23:34,100 --> 00:23:36,100
And I would suggest

613
00:23:36,100 --> 00:23:38,100
that the new scout master sent me this email:

614
00:23:38,100 --> 00:23:40,100
you'd go and discuss this with the committee

615
00:23:40,100 --> 00:23:42,100
and make sure that everybody is agreed

616
00:23:42,100 --> 00:23:44,100
on a way forward and you know things

617
00:23:44,100 --> 00:23:46,100
will smooth out. You're always going to have

